            "action_name": {
              "value": "Change Shape"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, divine, polymorph, transmutation)\n\nThe kithangian can take on the appearance of any Medium or Large animal. This doesn't change its Speed or their attack and damage modifiers with its Strikes, but it might change the damage type its Strikes deal.\n\n**Kithangian Venom**\nDC: 25\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\nMaximum Duration: 6 rounds\n- Stage 1: 2d6 poison damage (2 rounds)\n- Stage 2: 2d6 poison damage and sickened 1 (2 rounds)\n- Stage 3: 3d6 poison damage and sickened 2 (2 rounds)"
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
